      <marc:subfield code="a">Artist, animal lover and would-be swimming sensation Mimi Power knows what it&apos;s like to live under the tyranny of a three-year-old sister. Things have never been the same in the Power house since &quot;The Waby&quot; arrived. Finding creative space in all the chaos is getting harder by the minute for Mimi. But with the school art show looming and a prize too-good-to-give-up-on at stake, Mimi comes up with a plan that&apos;s three-year-old foolproof. Or is it? To know for sure, Mimi will have to tap into her big sister power and find her own little piece of the sky.</marc:subfield>
